  "contract": {
    "rules": [
      "Exact authenticated cart selection, one bargain activity and matching source product; private no-store",
      "Activity methods, global pickup flags, active isStore pickup stores scoped to source owner; no non-bargain union change",
      "UTC SQL clock comparison, nullable legacy windows, bounded REPEATABLE READ READ ONLY transaction; KV read before SQL snapshot",
      "Malformed or empty shipping response never restores both channels; refresh preserves invalid prior choice until explicit selection",
      "Types 1/2/3 may quote with addressId 0 and null address without selecting a saved default; strict quoted product type comparison"
    ],
    "remaining": [
      "Global flags/store ownership must still be enforced and rechecked by quote/create; selector is advisory, not authorization/reservation",
      "Same-city range/fees/dispatch and template lifecycle/internal concurrency",
      "Other activities still use legacy union selector",
      "Full PHP editor/copy/rebind/multi-SKU compatibility and A3i price policy",
      "Linux/workerd/real roles/native devices/providers and production release"
    ]
  },
